(Structured Digital Lifestyle Intervention in the Interpregnancy Period: A Multisite) Tj
T*
(Implementation Study) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Abstract) Tj
T*
(Background: Weight gain between pregnancies and during pregnancy is associated with) Tj
T*
(obstetric and neonatal complications. Few interventions target this critical window.) Tj
T*
(Methods: This multisite randomized protocol will evaluate a comprehensive lifestyle) Tj
T*
(program delivered primarily through digital platforms in postpartum women at increased) Tj
T*
(risk for adverse outcomes. Women will be recruited in the immediate postpartum period) Tj
T*
(\(days 2-3\) and randomized at week 6 postpartum. The intervention includes structured) Tj
T*
(coaching sessions delivered in-person or remotely, a Bluetooth-connected mobile) Tj
T*
(application linking to wearable activity trackers and digital scales, and content) Tj
T*
(addressing nutrition, physical activity, weight management, and mental well-being.) Tj
T*
(Intervention will be delivered during the postpartum period \(4 sessions over 6 months\) and) Tj
T*
(again during the subsequent pregnancy \(3 sessions across trimesters\). Control participants) Tj
T*
(will receive routine postpartum and antenatal care. Primary outcome is a composite) Tj
T*
(indicator of maternal and neonatal morbidity in the subsequent pregnancy. Secondary) Tj
T*
(outcomes will assess adherence, weight trajectories, and behavioral mediators. Data) Tj
T*
(collection includes medical records, anthropometric measurements, device-generated) Tj
T*
(activity and weight data, and questionnaires at standard intervals.) Tj
